          <div
            style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; border-bottom: 2px solid #f1f5f9; padding-bottom: 20px; margin-bottom: 28px;">
            <div>
              <span class="section-tag" style="margin-bottom: 8px;"><i class="fa-solid fa-id-card"></i> Statutory Due
