              <h2 style="font-size: 1.9rem; font-weight: 800; color: #0f172a; margin: 0 0 6px;">KYC &amp; AML Policy
                Code</h2>
              <p style="color: #64748b; font-size: 0.875rem; margin: 0;">Lord Krishna Financial Services Limited • Trade
                Name: Prest Loans</p>
            </div>
            <div style="text-align: right;">
              <span
                style="display: inline-block; padding: 6px 12px; background: #f1f5f9; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 600; color: #475569;">
